            "description": "Get list of users with pagination.\n\nEndpoint:  \nGET /api/users?page=2\n\nChecks:  \n\\- Response status code  \n\\- Response time  \n\\- Content-Type  \n\\- Pagination data  \n\\- User data structure  \n\\- Required fields  \n\\- Data types"
          },
          "response": []
